visional","resolution_note":"渾/籍/戎三端對話分辨；王濟轉述張華、裴頠與引古子房季劄。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":66,"last_line":66,"revision_id":2618531},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-wangrong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007","text":"戎在職雖無殊能，而庶績修理。後遷光祿勳、吏部尚書，以母憂去職。性至孝，不拘禮制，飲酒食肉，或觀弈棋，而容貌毀悴，杖然後起。裴頠往吊之，謂人曰：「若使一慟能傷人，濬沖不免滅性之譏也。」時和嶠亦居父喪，以禮法自持，量米而食，哀毀不逾於戎。帝謂劉毅曰：「和嶠毀頓過禮，使人憂之。」毅曰：「嶠雖寢苫食粥，乃生孝耳。至於王戎，所謂死孝，陛下當先憂之。」戎先有吐疾，居喪增甚。帝遣醫療之，並賜藥物，又斷賓客。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"s6r_kug_pk7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"裴頠","kind":"person","person_id":"svm_6fh_34r","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"濬沖","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"和嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"3fc_362_06e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"父","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"和嶠父未名，本來源尚未與其他父名交證。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangrong:p007:m0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"戎","kind":"person","person_id":"48e_04a_3d8","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"孝喪插敘武帝問劉毅，不與劉裕時護軍劉毅同人；母稱不升生母。"},{"id":"c-j